  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "CADCraft（二维制图）",
      "text": "> 平面图、孔系、标注与出图，可编辑图纸\n\n**版本**：0.1.0-dev.20261019.1 · **许可证**：Apache-2.0 · **技能**：12 个 · **MCP 服务**：1 个\n\n[English](README.en.md) · [安装](#安装) · [快速开始](#快速开始) · [项目结构](#项目结构)"
    },
    {
      "section": "项目定位",
      "text": "房间平面、法兰孔系、尺寸标注、图层清理与图框出图；毫米坐标、图层与出图比例可复核。\n\n本插件属于内容创作线，面向需要直接得到可编辑成果、而不是一段脚本或图片的用户。"
    },
    {
      "section": "一眼看懂",
      "text": "```text\n素材 / 需求 / 旧稿\n        │\n        ▼\nCADCraft（二维制图） 技能（检查 → 计划 → 执行 → 回读）"
    },
    {
      "section": "能力与边界",
      "text": "| 能力 | 说明 | 边界 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 检查 | 读取现有工程与素材状态 | 不修改未授权文件 |\n| 创建 | 按目标生成可编辑结构 | 事实与素材需来自输入 |\n| 编辑 | 局部修改并保留未涉及内容 | 修改后必须重新打开 |\n| 导出 | 输出目标格式并核对 | 导出成功不等于版面正确 |\n| 评审 | 按明确标准检查结果 | 不替代最终人工验收 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "架构与核心流程",
      "text": "```text\n宿主 / Agent\n   │  调用技能\n   ▼\nskills/cadcraft-*  ──►  MCP 编辑器 / 原生 CLI\n\n原则：\n\n1. 先只读检查，再计划，再执行。\n2. 每次写入保留原件或可回退版本。\n3. 导出后重新打开核对。\n4. 不确定的结果标记为待核对，不自动重放。"
    },
    {
      "section": "兼容性",
      "text": "| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| 宿主 | 支持 MCP Apps 或内置浏览器的宿主 |\n| Node.js | 24+（编辑器） |\n| 平台 | 以实际安装包与发行说明为准 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ncodex plugin marketplace add partme-ai/full-aigc-plugins\ncodex plugin add cadcraft@full-aigc-plugins\n```\n\n安装后重启宿主，先做只读检查。"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "1. 确认目标、输入素材和交付格式。\n2. 先检查现有工程，列出缺失项。\n3. 执行一次有界修改。\n4. 重新打开输出，核对结构与关键内容。\n5. 完成视觉或内容复核后交付。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "| 变量 | 用途 | 默认 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `CRAFT_WORKSPACE_ROOT` | 编辑器绑定的工作区 | 当前项目 |\n| `CRAFT_EDITOR_UPDATE` | 设为 `off` 跳过增强包下载 | 开启 |\n\n不要在工程或配置中写入密钥、令牌和私有路径。"
    },
    {
      "section": "扩展契约",
      "text": "新增技能时应使用 `cadcraft-` 前缀，声明触发条件和边界，通过 MCP 或固定 CLI 操作真实工程，修改后重新打开核验。"
    },
    {
      "section": "重试、幂等与恢复",
      "text": "- 失败后先检查当前工程状态。\n- 不自动重复已产生副作用的操作。\n- 重试使用新输出路径并保留旧回执。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据与状态",
      "text": "- 输入素材只读。\n- 输出工程、导出文件和临时目录分开。\n- 交付前确认文件可打开、内容完整。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全",
      "text": "- 不把未授权素材上传到第三方服务。\n- 敏感内容脱敏后再交付。\n- 发现泄露先轮换凭据，再清理文件。"
    },
    {
      "section": "可观测性与运行",
      "text": "记录命令、输出文件、关键结构和复核结果；交付前至少检查一次真实输出。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发与验证",
      "text": "```bash\nnode --test\npython3 -m pytest\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "打包与发布",
      "text": "版本与清单、市场、tag 一致；ZIP 根目录为 `cadcraft-plugin`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "升级与迁移",
      "text": "升级前备份工程；旧版本文件保持可打开；迁移后重新检查结构和导出。"
    },
    {
      "section": "故障排查",
      "text": "| 现象 | 检查 |\n|---|---|\n| 打不开工程 | 文件完整性、版本兼容 |\n| 编辑器空白 | Node.js 版本与工作区权限 |\n| 导出异常 | 字体、素材、输出路径 |\n| 结果不一致 | 重新打开并核对 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "项目结构",
      "text": "```text\ncadcraft-plugin/\n├── .zcode-plugin/      # ZCode 清单与 UI surface\n├── skills/             # 12 个技能\n├── ui/                 # MCP Apps 编辑器"
    },
    {
      "section": "贡献与支持",
      "text": "提交问题时附上插件版本、宿主、输入类型、命令、输出文件和预期结果。不要附敏感素材。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "Apache-2.0，见 [LICENSE](LICENSE)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "CADCraft（二维制图）",
      "text": "> Floor plans, hole patterns, dimensions and sheet output\n\n**Version**: 0.1.0-dev.20261019.1 · **License**: Apache-2.0 · **Skills**: 12 · **MCP server**: 1\n\n[简体中文](README.md) · [Install](#installation) · [Quick start](#quick-start) · [Project layout](#project-layout)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Positioning",
      "text": "Floor plans, hole patterns, dimensioning, layer cleanup and sheet output. Millimeter coordinates, layers and plot scales are verifiable.\n\nThis plugin belongs to the content-creation line and is for users who need an editable result, not a script or a flat image."
    },
    {
      "section": "At a glance",
      "text": "```text\nassets / requirements / old drafts\n        │\n        ▼\nCADCraft（二维制图） skill (inspect → plan → execute → read back)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Capabilities and boundaries",
      "text": "| Capability | What it does | Boundary |\n|---|---|---|\n| Inspect | Read the current project and assets | No edits without authorization |\n| Create | Build an editable structure from the goal | Facts and assets come from input |\n| Edit | Change the requested scope only | Reopen after every edit |\n| Export | Produce the target format and verify | A successful export is not correct layout |\n| Review | Check against explicit criteria | Not a substitute for final human acceptance |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture and core flow",
      "text": "```text\nHost / agent\n   │  invokes a skill\n   ▼\nskills/cadcraft-*  ──►  MCP editor / native CLI\n\nRules:\n\n1. Inspect read-only, then plan, then execute.\n2. Keep the original or a rollback version.\n3. Reopen the export before trusting it.\n4. Mark uncertain results for review; never replay automatically."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "| Item | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Host | Hosts with MCP Apps or a built-in browser |\n| Node.js | 24+ (editor) |\n| Platforms | Follow the actual package and release notes |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "```bash\ncodex plugin marketplace add partme-ai/full-aigc-plugins\ncodex plugin add cadcraft@full-aigc-plugins\n```\n\nRestart the host and start read-only."
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "1. Confirm goal, inputs, and delivery format.\n2. Inspect the current project and list gaps.\n3. Make one bounded change.\n4. Reopen the output and verify structure and key content.\n5. Complete visual or content review before delivery."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "| Variable | Purpose | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| `CRAFT_WORKSPACE_ROOT` | Workspace bound to the editor | current project |\n| `CRAFT_EDITOR_UPDATE` | Set to `off` to skip the enhanced editor download | enabled |\n\nNever write secrets, tokens, or private paths into projects or configuration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Extension contract",
      "text": "New skills use the `cadcraft-` prefix, declare triggers and boundaries, operate through MCP or the pinned CLI, and reopen after every edit."
    },
    {
      "section": "Retry, idempotency, and recovery",
      "text": "- Inspect the current project after a failure.\n- Do not replay operations with side effects.\n- Retry with a new output path and keep the old receipt."
    },
    {
      "section": "Data and state",
      "text": "- Inputs are read-only.\n- Outputs, exports, and temporary directories are separate.\n- Confirm the file opens and content is complete before delivery."
    },
    {
      "section": "Security",
      "text": "- Do not upload unauthorized assets to third-party services.\n- Redact sensitive content before delivery.\n- On a suspected leak, rotate credentials before cleaning files."
    },
    {
      "section": "Observability and operation",
      "text": "Record command, output file, key structure, and review result; inspect at least one real output before delivery."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development and verification",
      "text": "```bash\nnode --test\npython3 -m pytest\n```"
    },
